cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use employee-voice-analytics in academic work, please cite it using
  the metadata below. The toolkit runs as a local CLI or on Databricks Spark
  over Bronze/Silver/Gold Delta tables.
type: software
title: "employee-voice-analytics"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
